**Rationale:**  
The statements enumerate every pre‑condition that must hold for a tool call (integrity verification, episode consistency, sample‑type rules, pressure/red‑line flags, prerequisite completions) and the exact post‑conditions that result when a call is permitted. They also capture all denial cases—prohibited tools, missing flags, mismatched episodes, disallowed samples, and red‑line or pressure conditions—so the policy function can be evaluated as a deterministic series of IF‑THEN checks. This makes the security requirements fully checkable and unambiguous.

